==Overview==
The hugely popular smartphone game "The Great Cat War" has been downloaded over 20 million times.<br>
In November 2015, "The Great Cat War" will celebrate its third anniversary, and we've put together a special feature that takes a closer look at the game's appeal.<br>
In addition to the history of "The Great Cat War", there is also a gallery of illustrations by the game's staff, which will make you a fan of "Cat".<br>
It also includes detailed data on the kimo-kawaii cat characters to help you get the most out of the game.<br>
It also includes a special download bonus to celebrate the 3rd anniversary of the game, so it's a book that will satisfy all "Cat War" users!

3rd anniversary special bonus
